        "doc": "Derives the contract address this deployer would create from a salt.\\n\\n# Arguments\\n\\n* `e` - Contract execution environment.\\n* `salt` - Deterministic 32-byte deployment salt.\\n\\n# Returns\\n\\nThe contract address derived from this deployer and `salt`.\\n\\n# Errors\\n\\nThis function emits no contract-defined errors.",
        "name": "get_predicted_address",
